{"2530560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rusty Rabbit", "steam_appid": 2530560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3467440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/8fb6aaceace04552e5c6b6962488ac14.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/8fb6aaceace04552e5c6b6962488ac14.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=895 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth has entered another ice age. Humans have abandoned the planet. Over time, those who would inherit the world are... rabbits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This civilization of highly evolved of rabbits took to the task of reclaiming human technology in the ruins known as &quot;Smokestack Mountain&quot;. This fluffy society has long refered to humans as &quot;giants&quot; from the past and think the book Peter Rabbit is the Bible. Those fearless enough to explore this vast unknown are called &quot;rust diggers.&quot; Our protagonist, an old rabbit named Stamp, is one such rust digger, making his living by excavating and exploring for a profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, on his way back from an excavation under Smokestack Mountain, our hero- a rabbit called Stamp, encounters a rust digging team known as the &quot;BBs&quot; and joins them in a quest to delve deeper into the mysterious riches of Smokestack Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way he discovers information about his estranged daughter, hinting at her peril and revealing hidden truths about the world he once believed in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/f6d0c56ec874533874d9ceaf6dd9e6e9.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/f6d0c56ec874533874d9ceaf6dd9e6e9.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A middle-aged, grumpy and impatient rabbit, obsessed with collecting junk and tinkering with machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/0780a511eaf22485cffa33e22f1232f9.avif?t=1767229742\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this adventure, Stamp will meet many friendly, fluffy and adorabe villagers, who will help him on his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/ec3ff70cabb28c39bc758f1573d295f8.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/ec3ff70cabb28c39bc758f1573d295f8.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/ac52aaf257bdd5bd842e9eca0073a5f7.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/ac52aaf257bdd5bd842e9eca0073a5f7.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mech's ninja-like speed and mobility, explore the ruins by smashing through blocks, and loot any treasure that awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/1b8bf42ef9e045a0bb24e53f251c093e.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/1b8bf42ef9e045a0bb24e53f251c093e.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/fe5bc8ba0dfcb3991c5099f77e9d3947.avif?t=1767229742\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and abilities are at your command to navigate dungeons and take on enemies. Power up as you collect junk and discover new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/16c966fef0223b6bd41c88af87e1f7f1.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/16c966fef0223b6bd41c88af87e1f7f1.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/14b5097e8e5866190318e88fe7194dd1.avif?t=1767229742\" width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your mech with parts and materials collected from the ruins! Level up Stamp's abilities as you battle various foes and baosses to reclaim hidden treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/f1e081de79ca8e143d77b8ece2cbfdb5.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/f1e081de79ca8e143d77b8ece2cbfdb5.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=445 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/8fb6aaceace04552e5c6b6962488ac14.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/8fb6aaceace04552e5c6b6962488ac14.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=895 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth has entered another ice age. Humans have abandoned the planet. Over time, those who would inherit the world are... rabbits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This civilization of highly evolved of rabbits took to the task of reclaiming human technology in the ruins known as &quot;Smokestack Mountain&quot;. This fluffy society has long refered to humans as &quot;giants&quot; from the past and think the book Peter Rabbit is the Bible. Those fearless enough to explore this vast unknown are called &quot;rust diggers.&quot; Our protagonist, an old rabbit named Stamp, is one such rust digger, making his living by excavating and exploring for a profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, on his way back from an excavation under Smokestack Mountain, our hero- a rabbit called Stamp, encounters a rust digging team known as the &quot;BBs&quot; and joins them in a quest to delve deeper into the mysterious riches of Smokestack Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way he discovers information about his estranged daughter, hinting at her peril and revealing hidden truths about the world he once believed in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/f6d0c56ec874533874d9ceaf6dd9e6e9.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/f6d0c56ec874533874d9ceaf6dd9e6e9.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A middle-aged, grumpy and impatient rabbit, obsessed with collecting junk and tinkering with machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/0780a511eaf22485cffa33e22f1232f9.avif?t=1767229742\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this adventure, Stamp will meet many friendly, fluffy and adorabe villagers, who will help him on his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/ec3ff70cabb28c39bc758f1573d295f8.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/ec3ff70cabb28c39bc758f1573d295f8.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/ac52aaf257bdd5bd842e9eca0073a5f7.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras_big/ac52aaf257bdd5bd842e9eca0073a5f7.avif?t=1767229742 width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mech's ninja-like speed and mobility, explore the ruins by smashing through blocks, and loot any treasure that awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/1b8bf42ef9e045a0bb24e53f251c093e.avif?t=1767229742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse